{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Kle1W7GgNJ1793230268.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>聯邦快遞第三季度業績好過市場預期，但股價在延長交易時段曾跌超過百分之6。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利2.9億美元，按年倒退五成半。經調整每股攤薄盈利3.74美元，較預期多38美仙。收入228億美元，較預期多超過4億美元。</p><p></p><p>並上調全年度業績指引，經調整每股攤薄盈利上限由之前的18.1美元，調升至18.6美元。資本開支預測維持在39億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:53.998867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T17:18:24.625613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:18:13.249210+00:00","content_hash":"29828190699367a779e34a9e24afc090c15c28994596003c2afe59618b874cc8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:53.998867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}